{"id":"perf_d33f9ef59feb68e9","title":"德奈什·瓦尔永钢琴独奏会丨上海交响乐团音乐季","city":"上海","venue":"捷豹上海交响音乐厅","hall":"演艺厅","startTime":"2026-10-29T11:15:00.000Z","endTime":"2026-10-29T13:15:00.000Z","weekday":"周四","dateLabel":"10/29","timeLabel":"19:15","price":"¥120 - ¥480","priceTiers":[120,240,360,480],"description":"匈牙利钢琴家德奈什·瓦尔永以严谨的音乐理解和富有层次的演奏风格受到关注。他长期深耕德奥音乐传统，在贝多芬、舒曼等作品的诠释中展现出对作品结构与情感内涵的深入把握。\n\n本场音乐会，他将从巴赫的复调秩序出发，穿越贝多芬晚期作品的沉思世界，再进入舒曼充满幻想与回忆的浪漫主义篇章。一场关于时间、记忆与情感的音乐旅程将在琴键之间展开。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21827&supportSeat=Y","sourceName":"上海交响乐团官网","sourceUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21827&supportSeat=Y","scrapedAt":"2026-08-17T13:00:34.458Z","ensemble":"德奈什·瓦尔永钢琴独奏会丨上海交响乐团","performers":["德奈什·瓦尔永"],"composers":["巴赫","贝多芬","舒曼"],"program":[{"composer":"巴赫","title":"a小调第二英国组曲，BWV 807","confidence":"official","id":"program_2f97f0fe66c5eb4f","workId":"work_bd98bdd1f8c0adca"},{"composer":"贝多芬","title":"E大调第三十钢琴奏鸣曲，作品109","confidence":"official","id":"program_a5a82ddbf4b84813","workId":"work_ab15936313251094"},{"composer":"舒曼","title":"C大调幻想曲，作品17","confidence":"official","id":"program_c5e37745c8865c1b","workId":"work_940352437af6cc7d"},{"composer":"舒曼","title":"《童年情景》，作品15","confidence":"official","id":"program_1b7b9ce48e0cfabd","workId":"work_81bea6e63bc5608c"}],"tags":["巴赫","贝多芬","舒曼","交响","钢琴","独奏"],"dataQuality":"scraped","projectId":"event_8a4b1fe2bca63786","sources":[{"sourceId":"shsymphony-official","sourceName":"上海交响乐团官网","sourceRecordId":"shsymphony_21827","sourceUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21827&supportSeat=Y","ticketUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21827&supportSeat=Y","scrapedAt":"2026-08-17T13:00:34.458Z"}]}